  "prefLabel": "Plc 206.34 Records of Decisions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 206.34 Records of Decisions. The OPLC shall keep a final board decision for at least 5 years following its date of issuance, unless the director of the division of records management of the department of state sets a different retention period pursuant to rules adopted under RSA 5:40 or approves a different retention schedule.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 200) #13427, eff 8-4-22; ss by #13837 eff 12-28-23 (formerly Plc 206.31) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 200)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc100-200.html"
